help=Action\nF5/F7, Alt+F5/F7 Previous/next command or file\nF6, Shift+F6, Alt+F6 Run active, run+next, run file\nCtrl+F6 Cycle M/MF/A mode\nF8 Offset pin on/off, Shift+F8 move\nF9/Ctrl+F9, Shift+F9 Pause/resume, manual focus resume, stop/off\nCtrl+Alt+1..9/0 Run list item 1..9/10\n\nControls\nC key command, P pause, K focus pause, T delay, V variables\n+ insert, - delete; Auto repeat, RePin offset reanchor, OR override resolution, XY pointer info\n\nRecord mode\nCtrl+Shift+T String input\n\nEdit files\nL Reload, N New, S Save, D Duplicate, E TSK edit; ^/v/X/B move/delete/block
